    <string name="howto_ai_body">Tap Solve with AI. The AI uses Manhattan Distance + Linear Conflict. For 3×3 and 4×4 the solution is optimal; if a 4×4 takes too long you can keep going or pick Quick Solution. For 5×5 the AI works in stages and the solution is not guaranteed to be the shortest. A hint only highlights the next tile.</string>
    <string name="howto_ai_chip">AI is playing</string>
    <string name="howto_ai_title">AI Solver</string>
    <string name="howto_corner_body">The last two tiles of a row are the hardest. Put the last tile in the corner first, the one before it just below, then rotate both into place together.</string>
    <string name="howto_corner_title">Corner Technique</string>
    <string name="howto_first_row_body">Solve the top row first, then the left column. Leave them alone afterwards; what remains is a smaller puzzle.</string>
    <string name="howto_first_row_title">First Row Strategy</string>
    <string name="howto_gesture_drag">Drag</string>
    <string name="howto_gesture_swipe">Swipe</string>
    <string name="howto_gesture_tap">Tap</string>
    <string name="howto_goal_body">Arrange the tiles in order starting from 1, with the empty slot in the bottom-right corner. In image mode, arrange the pieces until the picture is whole.</string>
    <string name="howto_goal_title">Goal</string>
    <string name="howto_move_body">Tap a tile next to the empty slot to slide it. Tap a tile in the same row or column to slide the whole line. You can also swipe on the board toward the empty slot, or drag a tile with your finger.</string>
    <string name="howto_move_title">How to Move</string>
    <string name="howto_pattern_body">Spot patterns: three tiles in a 2×2 block can rotate around the empty slot without disturbing anything else. This pattern is used again and again to move tiles into place.</string>
    <string name="howto_pattern_title">Pattern Recognition</string>
    <string name="howto_score_max">up to %1$s</string>
    <string name="howto_score_more">more than %1$s</string>
    <string name="howto_scoring_body">Stars are based on moves only. Time is used for records. Games that use the AI or a hint do not count toward records. Undo still counts as a move.</string>
    <string name="howto_scoring_title">Scoring</string>
